WEBVTT

00:01:25.621 --> 00:01:30.538
Together, these changes increase
your chances of a heart attack or stroke.

00:01:30.579 --> 00:01:32.954
When your brain senses stress,

00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:35.121
it activates your autonomic 
nervous system.

00:01:35.163 --> 00:01:37.329
Through this network of nerve connections,

00:01:37.371 --> 00:01:40.246
your big brain communicates 
stress to your enteric,

00:01:40.288 --> 00:01:43.079
or intestinal nervous system.

00:01:44.954 --> 00:01:48.788
Besides causing butterflies
in your stomach,

00:01:48.829 --> 00:01:52.621
this brain-gut connection can disturb
the natural rhythmic contractions

00:01:52.663 --> 00:01:55.079
that move food through your gut,

00:01:55.121 --> 00:01:57.496
leading to irritable bowel syndrome,

00:01:57.538 --> 00:02:00.454
and can increase 
your gut sensitivity to acid,